"name": "VIP Ambush",
"stratConScenarioType": "NONE",
"shortBriefing": "Ambush and eliminate VIP, evade reinforcements.",
"detailedBriefing": "An enemy VIP has been left exposed, presenting a rare opportunity to eliminate a high-value target. Your mission is to execute the VIP before their reinforcements arrive. This individual’s removal will cripple enemy operations, disrupt their chain of command, and eliminate a key asset from the battlefield.\n\nExpect the enemy to stall for time, deploying fast-moving elements or defensive tactics to delay your strike. Speed and precision are critical—do not allow them the time to reinforce or extract the target. If you hesitate, they will escape or be reinforced, and this opportunity will be lost.\n\nThe enemy will control the battlefield at the end of the engagement, meaning there will be no chance for recovery or salvage. This is a surgical strike—neutralize the target and withdraw before the enemy locks down the area.",
